        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 12,
        "line_end": 15,
        "exact_text": "3. Generate functions_catalog.xlsx with two worksheets:\n   - Sheet 1 \"Function Catalog\": three columns (No., Function Name, Description), sorted alphabetically, with bold header row and colored background\n   - Sheet 2 \"Category Statistics\": group functions by functional category (e.g., Type Conversion, Math Operations, Sequence Operations, I/O, Object & Class Inspection, Iterator Tools, etc.), showing function count per category and listing all function names under each category\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "a90947cb47c605fd96fbf43ebd7e788fe13b796966c46a482fd9f1a861aea8e2",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
